    "gp_section_612045643195614061": {
      "settings": {
        "checksum": "7fe9fdbee6af500ae311f51a44d1acba3bd9be04be31060a1562fe4eca7a950c_1_1_1_0__1",
        "gg2qsNeOyLE_text": "<p>You can try our formulas <strong>risk-free</strong> to see how they work for you — thanks to our <strong>Satisfaction Guarantee</strong>. <i>90-day money-back. 30-day feel-it promise. If it doesn't work, we refund. No questions. No hassle.</i></p>",
        "gg3yYtVhkip_text": "<p>3</p>",
        "ggCTWh4SrX9_text": "<p>4</p>",
        "ggGF1FdOH4H_text": "<p>Over <strong>1.5M women and men </strong>can feel the difference in their symptoms. <i>Our formulas are trusted by a growing community of health-conscious adults who verify before they buy.</i></p>",
        "ggGN60c1HmP_text": "<p>2</p>",
        "ggTHhJBdoCq_text": "<p>5 Reasons Why</p>",
        "gggACQDLEcH_text": "<p>Our formulas only use <strong>science-backed nutrients</strong>. <i>Every ingredient is selected based on peer-reviewed research — not trends, not hype, not marketing convenience.</i></p>",
        "ggnpkNkUOZP_text": "<p>We have 100<strong>% science-made formulas</strong> developed by a Nutritional Scientist. <i>Our medical advisory board includes licensed physicians and researchers who personally evaluate every formulation.</i></p>",
        "ggoUJxNLG04_text": "<p>We help customers <strong>manage their health in a healthy way.</strong> <i>No mega-dosing. No proprietary blends hiding what's inside. Just clinically informed doses you can actually verify.</i></p>",
        "ggrULl34RZ7_text": "<p>5</p>",
        "ggwV2FtIY93_text": "<p>1</p>",
        "ggxPWVga62j_text": "<p>You Should Try&nbsp;</p><p>Wellness Nest</p>"
      },
      "type": "gp-section-612045643195614061"
    },
    "gp_section_612047469848560147": {
      "settings": {
        "checksum": "aa24fd72f7f08f9167b04b509d25ea17c22c01506c85bc7ed4a715e1caf05119_1_1_1_0__1",
        "ggC-ycm4Hgy_text": "Wellness Nest's Formulas",
        "ggIGCGd1fsM_text": "<p><strong>RESEARCH LEAD • UNIVERSITY OF OXFORD</strong></p>",
        "ggJ3xDrUZfb_text": "<p><span style=\"font-size:px;\"><strong>Dr. Latt Mansor</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:px;\"><strong>PhD</strong></span></p>",
        "ggP3IWrFz4Y_text": "<p>\"ShilaSource preserves the full spectrum of fulvic acid through low-temperature extraction. Most brands destroy the very compounds that make Shilajit effective.\"</p>",
        "ggUpg20Ceno_text": "<p>Trusted by Professionals</p>",
        "ggYNPJH3sW0_text": "<p>\"Every formulation I review for Wellness Nest goes through the same standard I'd apply to a clinical study. If the data doesn't support it, it doesn't make the label.\"</p>",
        "ggkVtm79lXH_text": "<p><span style=\"font-size:px;\"><strong>Dr. Jeff Vogel</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:px;\"><strong>MD, MPH</strong></span></p>",
        "ggrBBCqCjgq_text": "<p><strong>BOARD-CERTIFIED • MEN'S HEALTH</strong></p>",
        "ggt8081eGKr_text": "Meet the Experts Behind",
        "ggvje3bJ3J-_text": "<p><strong>BIOCHEMIST • HUMAN KINETICS</strong></p>",
        "ggwF_IlT35S_text": "<p><span style=\"font-size:px;\"><strong>Dr. Rajesh Sharma&nbsp;</strong></span><br><span style=\"font-size:px;\"><strong>Director of Quality Assurance</strong></span></p>",
        "ggxXlg3HiD1_text": "<p>\"FusiForce uses the clinically validated 5g dose — the same dosage that 700+ peer-reviewed studies have confirmed for strength, recovery, and cognitive performance. No shortcuts.\"</p>"
      },
      "type": "gp-section-612047469848560147"
    },
    "gp_section_612049063180763667": {
      "settings": {
        "checksum": "42f74d998b71093a9049874894cf3da0845ff8abf23a6a901e4d41a6410b1d6f_1_1_1_0__1",
        "gg092gOx8GW_text": "<p>A Note from the Founder</p>",
        "ggDH8sTo-9U_text": "<p><i>\"I didn't start this company to sell supplements. I started it because I lost the two people who mattered most.\"</i></p>",
        "ggJU8aZ9ev6_text": "<p>\"My mission is to live the longest, healthiest life possible - and to prove every single thing I put in my body along the way. If a formula can't survive a lab report, it doesn't deserve to survive on your shelf.\"</p>",
        "gg_9dlGZcXO_text": "Why I Built<br><span style=\"color:#008346;\">Wellness Nest</span>",
        "ggcqDjZNBV-_text": "<p>Eleven years ago, my mother died from a stroke. Three years later, my father suffered one too. He's been in a vegetative state ever since.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Those moments rewired how I think about health. I stopped trusting labels and started demanding proof. I traveled to 12+ countries, visiting manufacturing facilities, studying regulations, testing every product I could find.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>What I discovered was an industry built on marketing, not science. Proprietary blends that hide what's inside. Claims with no verification. Products designed to sell — not to work.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Wellness Nest is my answer. Every formula I sell, I take myself. Every batch we produce, we publish the lab report. Not because regulators require it — but because you deserve the same standard I demand for my own family.</p>",
        "ggjraiioll__text": "<p>- Wellness Nest, Founder</p>"
      },
      "type": "gp-section-612049063180763667"
    },
